!! Current Status

By ((Robin Powell|my)) count, we have checkpointed 108 words; the ma'oste has 1091 lines, so that puts us at 10% completed.

It should be noted, however, that we've already done most of the controversial and hard stuff, and that there are many words in the ma'oste we have no intention of doing (PA* and LE* come to mind).
